      "rationale": "Natural language processing or structured diff analysis could automatically compare the feature change list against the specification document to flag missing or incomplete feature coverage before human review begins.",
      "required_data": ["Machine-readable feature change list", "Structured or parseable specification document", "Coverage mapping rules"],
      "constraints": ["Document format is unspecified; free-form text reduces automation accuracy", "Requires consistent structure in the feature change list"],
      "confidence": "low"
